	(text "BEC path - Q1 P-channel FET, drain 5V_IN, source V5_SYS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 133.35 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "793503a9-61e7-5b2f-9ae2-428b0af71884")
	)
	(text "5 V INPUT OR: Q1 AO3401A and D1 1N5819WS.\nQ1 drain = 5V_IN, source = V5_SYS, gate = USB_VBUS. R7 pulls the gate down.\nD1 anode = USB_VBUS; cathode = V5_SYS.\nWithout USB, Q1's channel carries the external supply after its gate discharges.\nWith USB present, Q1 can be off: D1 and Q1's body diode can share the load.\nThere is no guaranteed BEC priority or lossless switchover.\nC19 (100 uF) is on 5V_IN; C8/C25/C79 are on V5_SYS.\nV5_SYS feeds U7 (system buck), U12 (sensor LDO) and the RGB status LED.\nGPS/ELRS and other 3.3 V IO use U7's output; servos stay on external 5V_IN.\nInput-only simulation: simulations/power_input.cir. See DESIGN_SPEC.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 150 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "88c2ee2d-1885-517a-9570-fe0bcb90b77f")
	)
	(text "POWER 2 - Q1 AO3401A P-FET + D1 1N5819WS SCHOTTKY.  5V_IN (external BEC, J3 pin 7) OR USB_VBUS -> V5_SYS.\nUSB present turns Q1 OFF, so a host can never back-feed the BEC, the servo rows or the ESC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aa42f282-c85e-560c-b0d1-c3f35db9a124")
	)
	(text "V5_SYS - the two 3.3 V regulators and the status LED, nothing else"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c43c052f-7a2f-56b9-b82a-ccde06228d3c")
	)
	(text "USB_VBUS feeds the D1 Schottky and the Q1 gate on POWER 2 directly; no inrush or current limiting on this\nsheet, and no data ESD array any more - U8 USBLC6-2SC6 was JLC Extended and is removed (DESIGN_SPEC \"Decisions\"),\nso D+/D- go straight from J4 into the 27 R series pair R22/R23, as on the madflight FC3v2. The RP2354B USB pins\ncarry their own on-die ESD structures; a board-level array is what this design gives up, deliberately."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 193.191 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ea73e1b2-0bbe-5aff-9322-649251278bf8")
	)
